  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_header.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=008080&label=DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-008080?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-008080?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252ftemples-reimagined%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看结构\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_overview.webp\" alt=\"概览\"></p>\n<p>本模组支持 Forge、Fabric 和 NeoForge！请务必确认 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-structure-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moogs Structure Lib</a> 支持的版本。</p>\n<h3>关于</h3>\n<p>Moog's Temples Reimagined 在原版的寺庙旁添加了更大、经过重新设计的寺庙结构，且不会替换原版内容。包含沙漠、丛林、海洋、恶地和下界寺庙，以及一座自定义要塞。基于 MoogsStructureLib 构建。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252ftemples-reimagined%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"在 3D 中实时浏览所有结构\"></a></p>\n<h3>依赖项</h3>\n<p><strong>MoogsStructureLib</strong> - 本模组需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-structure-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoogsStructureLib</a> 才能运行。请确保与本模组一同安装。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_features.webp\" alt=\"特性与展示\"></p>\n<h3>建筑结构</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>沙漠寺庙</strong></li>\n<li><strong>丛林寺庙</strong></li>\n<li><strong>海洋寺庙</strong></li>\n<li><strong>恶地寺庙</strong></li>\n<li><strong>下界寺庙</strong></li>\n<li><strong>要塞</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/7edc1556b8934fe38ccc3179e2365c3c.png\" alt=\"合集截图\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_discord.webp\" alt=\"Discord\"></p>\n<p>获得回复的最佳且最快的方式是加入我们的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmtr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_promo.webp\" alt=\"BH 赞助\"></a></p>",
